##

---

## 🧱 Architecture Overview

**Scrape → Store Raw Files → Insert to DB → (Future) Clean & Analyse**

- Each scrape run creates a **snapshot**
- Raw data is preserved as JSONL/CSV (audit trail)
- Database stores historical prices (no overwrites)

---

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- Python 3.9+
- PostgreSQL
- Alembic (database migrations)
- psycopg (Postgres driver)
- requests
- python-dotenv

---

## 📁 Project Structure

project/
├── src/
│ ├── scraper/ # Data scraping logic
│ ├── loaders/ # Database insertion scripts
│ └── common/ # Shared utilities (paths, helpers)
├── db/
│ └── alembic/ # Database migrations
├── data/
│ ├── raw/ # Raw snapshot files (gitignored)
│ └── processed/ # Future cleaned datasets
├── .env.example
├── alembic.ini
├── requirements.txt
└── README.md



