## ⚙️ Setup Instructions

### 1️⃣ Clone the repository
copy or clone
cd project

### 2️⃣ Create virtual environment
python -m venv .venv

.\.venv\Scripts\Activate.ps1


### 3️⃣ Install dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt
playwright install


### PostgreSQL Setup
CREATE USER grocery_user WITH PASSWORD 'strong_password';
CREATE DATABASE grocery_db OWNER grocery_user;

### Configure environment variables
cp .env.example .env

## edit env
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+psycopg://grocery_user:strong_password@localhost:5432/grocery_db
DATABASE_URL_PG=postgresql://grocery_user:strong_password@localhost:5432/grocery_db


### 🧬 Database Migrations

--run migration create table
alembic upgrade head

-- verify
alembic current


## Test rollback (proves downgrade works) - DO NOT RUN WHEN SETUP

--see current version
alembic current

--Roll back one migration
alembic downgrade -1


### 🕷️ Run the Scraper

python -m src.scraper.keells_scrape_raw


