### Create canonical groups for a small demo set (10–30 items)

Example for “dhal”:

SELECT clean_product_id, store, canonical_name, normalized_name, canonical_group_id
FROM public.clean_products
WHERE normalized_name ILIKE '%dhal%'
ORDER BY store, canonical_name;



